clause.content:
all principal
				recipients and subrecipients and the amount of funds disbursed to each
				principal recipient and subrecipient on the fiscal cycle of the grant;

a
				list of all countries imposing import duties and internal taxes on any goods or
				services financed by the Global Fund;

a description of
				the types of goods or services on which the import duties and internal taxes
				are levied;

the status of
				country
				status-agreements;
